event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/dev_d002.md\", \"content\": \"This is dispatch d002: implement the \\\"greet, tested\\\" mission in the subject repository.\\n\\nRequirements (all three must be satisfied):\\n\\n1. Create `src/greet.py` with a function `greet(name)` that returns the string\\n   `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` (i.e. `greet(\\\"Alice\\\")` returns `\\\"Hello, Alice!\\\"`).\\n\\n2. Create `tests/test_greet.py` with tests covering:\\n   - a normal name (e.g. greet(\\\"Alice\\\") == \\\"Hello, Alice!\\\")\\n   - the empty string (greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\")\\n\\n3. Ensure `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` run from the repo root exits 0\\n   (all tests pass, no import errors).\\n\\nDo this only in ~/subject on your own branch. When done:\\n- Run the test command yourself and confirm it exits 0.\\n- Commit your work to your branch.\\n- Reply with a summary of what you did, including the exact test command output/exit code.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

